---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LEGAL_NAME, AGENCY } from "../data/site";

const updated = "30 June 2026";
---
<Base
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms governing your use of The Micro Agency Ltd website, including trademarks, content, liability and governing law."
>
  <PageHeader kicker="Governance" title="Terms of Use" />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap-narrow prose">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <p>
        These terms govern your use of this website, operated by {LEGAL_NAME}
        ("we", "us", "our"), trading as {AGENCY}. By using the site you agree to
        these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.
        <!-- [TODO: solicitor review; add registered company number, registered office and any client engagement terms before launch.] -->
      </p>

      <h2>Use of the site</h2>
      <p>
        The content here is provided for general information about our services
        and thinking. It is not advice for your specific account or
        circumstances, and no client relationship is formed until we have agreed
        an engagement in writing. You may view and share the content for your own
        non-commercial reference, but you may not copy, republish or exploit it
        commercially without our permission.
      </p>

      <h2>No guarantee of results</h2>
      <p>
        Statistics on this site are cited with a named, dated source in the page
        markup and are indicative of the platform generally, not promises of
        performance. Advertising outcomes depend on many factors specific to your
        account, market and budget. Nothing here should be read as a guarantee of
        any particular result.
      </p>

      <h2>Trademarks</h2>
      <p>
        Microsoft, Bing, LinkedIn, Copilot, Xbox and the Microsoft logo are
        trademarks of the Microsoft group of companies. Google and Google Ads are
        trademarks of Google LLC. {LEGAL_NAME} is an independent agency.
        References to Microsoft products, services or partner status, including
        the Microsoft Advertising Elite Partner designation, do not imply that
        Microsoft authored, sponsors or endorses this site or its content.
      </p>

      <h2>External links and embeds</h2>
      <p>
        The site may link to or embed third-party content, such as a booking tool
        or video. We are not responsible for the content, policies or
        availability of third-party services, and your use of them is governed by
        their own terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        We take care to keep this site accurate and available, but provide it "as
        is" without warranties. To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are
        not liable for any loss arising from reliance on the general content of
        this site. Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited
        under law, such as for death or personal injury caused by negligence, or
        for fraud.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales, and the courts
        of England and Wales have exclusive jurisdiction over any dispute.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
